{"title":"Digital Marketing","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Digital Marketing","format":{"html":{"toc":false}}},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"page-header\">\n  <p class=\"page-eyebrow\">Projects</p>\n  <h2>Digital Marketing Projects</h2>\n  <p class=\"page-desc\">A collection of my work done at Cal Poly Pomona during my time as a graduate student in the Digital Marketing program.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"projects-grid\">\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 1: Off-Page SEO ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm1')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">💻</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">Trauma Resource Institute Internship</p>\n    <h3>Off-Page SEO</h3>\n    <p>Over the internship period I conducted an audit for TRI's site to help see how we could strengthen TRI's visibility with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Audit</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 2: Mock Campaign; LA Fitness ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm2')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">📱</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">LA Fitness Mock Partnership</p>\n    <h3>A Holiday Membership Campaign</h3>\n    <p>Conducted a campaign focused on buddy passes becoming members for LA Fitness during their peak sign-up season around the New Year.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Social Media</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 3: Qulatrics Survey ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm3')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">📝</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">Qualtrics Survey</p>\n    <h3>Hidden Label Survey</h3>\n    <p>A Qualtrics survey was used to assess the way in which attributes (color, material, shape) of various priced skin tints matter most to the consumer, and whether packaging preferences differ between luxury vs. non-luxury brands.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Qualtrics</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<!-- ── CARD 4: Portfolio Presentation ── -->\n<div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openPresentation()\">\n  <div class=\"card-icon\">📽️</div>\n  <p class=\"card-type\">Portfolio Overview</p>\n  <h3>Portfolio Presentation</h3>\n  <p>A slide deck overview of all five digital marketing projects from my CPP MSDM program.</p>\n  <div class=\"card-footer\">\n    <span class=\"card-tag\">RevealJS</span>\n    <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ── MODAL ── -->\n<div class=\"project-detail\" id=\"projectDetail\">\n  <div class=\"detail-panel\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\" onclick=\"closeProject()\">✕</button>\n    <div id=\"detailContent\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"project-detail\" id=\"presentationModal\">\n  <div class=\"detail-panel\" style=\"width:100vw;height:100vh;max-width:100vw;max-height:100vh;padding:0;border-radius:0;position:relative;\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\" onclick=\"closePresentation()\" style=\"position:fixed;top:20px;right:30px;z-index:9999;\">✕</button>\n    <iframe src=\"portfolio-presentation.html\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;display:block;\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst projects = {\n\n  dm1: {\n    icon: '💻', type: 'Off-Page SEO', title: 'Trauma Resource Institute',\n    tags: ['Audit', 'Analysis', 'SEO'],\n    data:      'Brand website was the platform investigated in the audit, using Squarespace and SEMRush analytics.',\n    problem:   'How can we strengthen TRI authority and visibility by aligning trauma-related content with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage?',\n    audience:  'People who are looking for assistance with trauma',\n    questions: 'How can we strengthen TRI authority and visibility by aligning trauma-related content with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage?',\n    impact:    'Increased attention to call to actions, in order to heighten the conversion rate on the TRI website.',\n    methods:   'Off-page SEO audit, keyword analysis, backlink review using SEMRush.',\n  },\n\n  dm2: {\n    icon: '📱', type: 'Mock Partnership', title: 'A Holiday Membership Campaign',\n    tags: ['KPIs', 'Call to Action', 'Ongoing Optimization'],\n    data:      'No real data used, a mock process',\n    problem:   'LA Fitness wanted the group to come up with ideas for a mock membership campaign, specifically for their social media and website.',\n    audience:  'Existing members and the buddies they bring with them, especially the buddies signing up for a membership.',\n    questions: 'How can LA Fitness convert buddy pass users into paying members during the New Year peak sign-up season?',\n    impact:    'Increased membership conversions through targeted social media and website campaigns during peak season.',\n    methods:   'Growth strategy, Paid advertising, Ongoing optimization.',\n  },\n\n  dm3: {\n    icon: '📝', type: 'Skin Tint Survey', title: 'Hidden Label Survey',\n    tags: ['Qualtrics', 'Data Analysis'],\n    data:      'Convenience sample of 106 respondents with random assignment of products.',\n    problem:   'How does packaging design influence consumer perception and purchase decisions for skin tints across luxury vs. non-luxury brands?',\n    audience:  '18+ consumers in the United States',\n    questions: 'How does packaging design influence consumer perception? Does it impact purchase decisions?',\n    impact:    'Insights into how packaging attributes drive purchase intent, informing brand positioning strategy for cosmetics companies.',\n    methods:   'Chi-square tests, MANOVA, ANOVA, Tukey Post-Hoc.',\n  },\n\n  dm4: {\n    icon: '🎯', type: 'Paid Media', title: 'Google Ads Campaign Strategy',\n    tags: ['PPC', 'Google Ads', 'CRO'],\n    data:      'Google Ads dashboard data, Google Analytics conversion data',\n    problem:   'Local service business was spending on ads with no clear ROI visibility or conversion tracking.',\n    audience:  'Small business owner / marketing decision maker',\n    questions: 'Which keywords and ad groups deliver the lowest cost-per-conversion? How should budget be allocated?',\n    impact:    'Improved ROAS and reduced wasted spend through better targeting and negative keyword management.',\n    methods:   'Campaign audit, keyword performance analysis, Quality Score optimization, bid strategy analysis.',\n  },\n\n};\n\n\nfunction openProject(id) {\n  const p = projects[id];\n  if (!p) return;\n  document.getElementById('detailContent').innerHTML = `\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8722A;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">${p.icon} ${p.type}</p>\n    <h3>${p.title}</h3>\n    <div class=\"detail-meta\">${p.tags.map(t=>`<span class=\"card-tag\">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Data &amp; Source</label><p>${p.data}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Managerial Problem</label><p>${p.problem}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Target Audience</label><p>${p.audience}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Research Questions / Objectives</label><p>${p.questions}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Expected Business Impact</label><p>${p.impact}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Methods</label><p>${p.methods}</p></div>\n  `;\n  document.getElementById('projectDetail').classList.add('open');\n}\n\nfunction closeProject() { document.getElementById('projectDetail').classList.remove('open'); }\ndocument.getElementById('projectDetail').addEventListener('click', function(e) { if (e.target === this) closeProject(); });\n\nfunction openPresentation() { document.getElementById('presentationModal').classList.add('open'); }\nfunction closePresentation() { document.getElementById('presentationModal').classList.remove('open'); }\ndocument.getElementById('presentationModal').addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n  if (e.target === this) closePresentation();\n});\n\n</script>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"page-header\">\n  <p class=\"page-eyebrow\">Projects</p>\n  <h2>Digital Marketing Projects</h2>\n  <p class=\"page-desc\">A collection of my work done at Cal Poly Pomona during my time as a graduate student in the Digital Marketing program.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"projects-grid\">\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 1: Off-Page SEO ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm1')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">💻</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">Trauma Resource Institute Internship</p>\n    <h3>Off-Page SEO</h3>\n    <p>Over the internship period I conducted an audit for TRI's site to help see how we could strengthen TRI's visibility with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Audit</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 2: Mock Campaign; LA Fitness ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm2')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">📱</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">LA Fitness Mock Partnership</p>\n    <h3>A Holiday Membership Campaign</h3>\n    <p>Conducted a campaign focused on buddy passes becoming members for LA Fitness during their peak sign-up season around the New Year.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Social Media</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ── CARD 3: Qulatrics Survey ── -->\n  <div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openProject('dm3')\">\n    <div class=\"card-icon\">📝</div>\n    <p class=\"card-type\">Qualtrics Survey</p>\n    <h3>Hidden Label Survey</h3>\n    <p>A Qualtrics survey was used to assess the way in which attributes (color, material, shape) of various priced skin tints matter most to the consumer, and whether packaging preferences differ between luxury vs. non-luxury brands.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Qualtrics</span>\n      <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n<!-- ── CARD 4: Portfolio Presentation ── -->\n<div class=\"project-card\" onclick=\"openPresentation()\">\n  <div class=\"card-icon\">📽️</div>\n  <p class=\"card-type\">Portfolio Overview</p>\n  <h3>Portfolio Presentation</h3>\n  <p>A slide deck overview of all five digital marketing projects from my CPP MSDM program.</p>\n  <div class=\"card-footer\">\n    <span class=\"card-tag\">RevealJS</span>\n    <span class=\"card-arrow\">→</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ── MODAL ── -->\n<div class=\"project-detail\" id=\"projectDetail\">\n  <div class=\"detail-panel\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\" onclick=\"closeProject()\">✕</button>\n    <div id=\"detailContent\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"project-detail\" id=\"presentationModal\">\n  <div class=\"detail-panel\" style=\"width:100vw;height:100vh;max-width:100vw;max-height:100vh;padding:0;border-radius:0;position:relative;\">\n    <button class=\"close-btn\" onclick=\"closePresentation()\" style=\"position:fixed;top:20px;right:30px;z-index:9999;\">✕</button>\n    <iframe src=\"portfolio-presentation.html\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;display:block;\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst projects = {\n\n  dm1: {\n    icon: '💻', type: 'Off-Page SEO', title: 'Trauma Resource Institute',\n    tags: ['Audit', 'Analysis', 'SEO'],\n    data:      'Brand website was the platform investigated in the audit, using Squarespace and SEMRush analytics.',\n    problem:   'How can we strengthen TRI authority and visibility by aligning trauma-related content with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage?',\n    audience:  'People who are looking for assistance with trauma',\n    questions: 'How can we strengthen TRI authority and visibility by aligning trauma-related content with high-impact external channels and strategic keyword usage?',\n    impact:    'Increased attention to call to actions, in order to heighten the conversion rate on the TRI website.',\n    methods:   'Off-page SEO audit, keyword analysis, backlink review using SEMRush.',\n  },\n\n  dm2: {\n    icon: '📱', type: 'Mock Partnership', title: 'A Holiday Membership Campaign',\n    tags: ['KPIs', 'Call to Action', 'Ongoing Optimization'],\n    data:      'No real data used, a mock process',\n    problem:   'LA Fitness wanted the group to come up with ideas for a mock membership campaign, specifically for their social media and website.',\n    audience:  'Existing members and the buddies they bring with them, especially the buddies signing up for a membership.',\n    questions: 'How can LA Fitness convert buddy pass users into paying members during the New Year peak sign-up season?',\n    impact:    'Increased membership conversions through targeted social media and website campaigns during peak season.',\n    methods:   'Growth strategy, Paid advertising, Ongoing optimization.',\n  },\n\n  dm3: {\n    icon: '📝', type: 'Skin Tint Survey', title: 'Hidden Label Survey',\n    tags: ['Qualtrics', 'Data Analysis'],\n    data:      'Convenience sample of 106 respondents with random assignment of products.',\n    problem:   'How does packaging design influence consumer perception and purchase decisions for skin tints across luxury vs. non-luxury brands?',\n    audience:  '18+ consumers in the United States',\n    questions: 'How does packaging design influence consumer perception? Does it impact purchase decisions?',\n    impact:    'Insights into how packaging attributes drive purchase intent, informing brand positioning strategy for cosmetics companies.',\n    methods:   'Chi-square tests, MANOVA, ANOVA, Tukey Post-Hoc.',\n  },\n\n  dm4: {\n    icon: '🎯', type: 'Paid Media', title: 'Google Ads Campaign Strategy',\n    tags: ['PPC', 'Google Ads', 'CRO'],\n    data:      'Google Ads dashboard data, Google Analytics conversion data',\n    problem:   'Local service business was spending on ads with no clear ROI visibility or conversion tracking.',\n    audience:  'Small business owner / marketing decision maker',\n    questions: 'Which keywords and ad groups deliver the lowest cost-per-conversion? How should budget be allocated?',\n    impact:    'Improved ROAS and reduced wasted spend through better targeting and negative keyword management.',\n    methods:   'Campaign audit, keyword performance analysis, Quality Score optimization, bid strategy analysis.',\n  },\n\n};\n\n\nfunction openProject(id) {\n  const p = projects[id];\n  if (!p) return;\n  document.getElementById('detailContent').innerHTML = `\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.68rem;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#E8722A;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">${p.icon} ${p.type}</p>\n    <h3>${p.title}</h3>\n    <div class=\"detail-meta\">${p.tags.map(t=>`<span class=\"card-tag\">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Data &amp; Source</label><p>${p.data}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Managerial Problem</label><p>${p.problem}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Target Audience</label><p>${p.audience}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Research Questions / Objectives</label><p>${p.questions}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Expected Business Impact</label><p>${p.impact}</p></div>\n    <div class=\"detail-section\"><label>Methods</label><p>${p.methods}</p></div>\n  `;\n  document.getElementById('projectDetail').classList.add('open');\n}\n\nfunction closeProject() { document.getElementById('projectDetail').classList.remove('open'); }\ndocument.getElementById('projectDetail').addEventListener('click', function(e) { if (e.target === this) closeProject(); });\n\nfunction openPresentation() { document.getElementById('presentationModal').classList.add('open'); }\nfunction closePresentation() { document.getElementById('presentationModal').classList.remove('open'); }\ndocument.getElementById('presentationModal').addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n  if (e.target === this) closePresentation();\n});\n\n</script>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["styles.css"],"toc":false,"embed-resources":false,"include-in-header":["header.html"],"output-file":"digital-marketing.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On